l ps\n                code 0\n          call subtract\n            call th\n              read n\n            call th\n              code 0\n        call multiply\n          call multiply\n            call multiply\n              code 3\n              read eps\n            read n\n          read w\n      call is-maximum\n        call subtract\n          code 0\n          call add\n            call add\n              call subtract\n                call ar\n                  read n\n                call ar\n                  code 0\n              call subtract\n                call ps\n                  read n\n                call ps\n                  code 0\n            call subtract\n              call th\n                read n\n              call th\n                code 0\n        call multiply\n          call multiply\n            call multiply\n              code 3\n              read eps\n            read n\n          read w\n  fold n\n>)
